{
 "title": "The Neighbour at Every Red Light",
 "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
 "tempo": 1.14,
 "keepGap": 0.28,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "This guy bought a brand new car, just to sit next to his neighbour at every red light.",
   "rate": "+22%",
   "pitch": "-3Hz",
   "volume": "+10%",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Every morning, Rohan and Arjun leave the same colony, at the same time, in two different cars.",
   "rate": "+30%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "First signal, they wave.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Second signal, thumbs up.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "+4Hz",
   "gap": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Fifth signal, they've run out of greetings.",
   "rate": "+28%",
   "pitch": "+6Hz",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "This went on for two years.",
   "rate": "+10%",
   "pitch": "-8Hz",
   "volume": "+10%",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "One day, Rohan rolls down the window,",
   "rate": "+30%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.05
  },
  {
   "text": "bro, where do you even work?",
   "rate": "+18%",
   "pitch": "+10Hz",
   "volume": "+12%",
   "gap": 0.22
  },
  {
   "text": "Same office.",
   "rate": "+14%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Same floor.",
   "rate": "+14%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Same team.",
   "rate": "+8%",
   "pitch": "-8Hz",
   "volume": "+15%",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Same meetings. Two years. Cameras off.",
   "rate": "+28%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.22
  },
  {
   "text": "So they made a carpool group.",
   "rate": "+30%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Sixty messages later, nobody knew who was driving, and Sharma ji's two minutes had become forty.",
   "rate": "+36%",
   "pitch": "+4Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Group, dead. Four cars again.",
   "rate": "+14%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "volume": "+10%",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Turns out, carpools never fail because of the car.",
   "rate": "+20%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "They fail because of the planning.",
   "rate": "+12%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "volume": "+10%",
   "gap": 0.22
  },
  {
   "text": "So they let an app do the boring part.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "A roster picks today's driver. One tap says you're ready. And everyone watches the car arrive. Live.",
   "rate": "+32%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Now it's one car, four friends, and three very bored parking spots.",
   "rate": "+28%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Sharma ji is still late though. But now, everyone can see exactly where.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "If you wave at your neighbour every morning, the app's called Sahyatri.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Check it out. Link in bio.",
   "rate": "+18%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "volume": "+10%",
   "gap": 0.3
  }
 ],
